## 异常处理

协程中的异常处理需要特别注意 `CancellationException` 不能被静默吞掉。

```kotlin
@HiltViewModel
class SafeViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val repository: DataRepository
) : ViewModel() {

    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow<UiState>(UiState.Loading)
    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()

    private val exceptionHandler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { _, throwable ->
        _uiState.value = UiState.Error(throwable.message ?: "未知错误")
    }

    fun loadData() {
        viewModelScope.launch(exceptionHandler) {
            _uiState.value = UiState.Loading
            val data = repository.getData()
            _uiState.value = UiState.Success(data)
        }
    }

    fun safeApiCall() {
        viewModelScope.launch {
            val result = runCatching { repository.getData() }
            result.fold(
                onSuccess = { _uiState.value = UiState.Success(it) },
                onFailure = { e ->
                    if (e is CancellationException) throw e
                    _uiState.value = UiState.Error(e.message ?: "请求失败")
                }
            )
        }
    }
}

sealed interface UiState {
    data object Loading : UiState
    data class Success(val data: List<Item>) : UiState
    data class Error(val message: String) : UiState
}
```

> **提示：** 使用 `runCatching` 时必须重新抛出 `CancellationException`，否则会破坏协程的取消机制。

---

## 小结

- `viewModelScope` 在 ViewModel 清除时自动取消协程，是最常用的作用域
- `lifecycleScope` + `repeatOnLifecycle` 确保 Flow 收集随生命周期启停
- 通过依赖注入提供 Dispatcher，IO 操作用 `Dispatchers.IO`，计算用 `Dispatchers.Default`
- 结构化并发通过 `coroutineScope` 和 `async` 实现并行请求
- 异常处理中必须正确处理 `CancellationException`，不能静默吞掉
